"collar_fall_note": "English prints 'F from D, the full measure (1 8/8)', a misprint (crop read 7 Oct); French '3 9/4 cm' (misprint), German '3 3/4 cm'. The cm column converts 1 1/4 in as 3 cm, so 3 3/4 cm is about 1 1/2 to 1 5/8 in; Plate 49 draws D-F about 1 3/4 to 1 7/8 in against D-E's 1 1/4. The lab takes 1 5/8 in (a judgement, not a reading)."
